        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yesu yeezungulula Galilaaya yoonayoona, ng'ayegeresa mu sinagoga dhaibwe, era ng'abakobera Amawulire Amalungi ag'Obwakyabazinga yaawonia buli bulwaire na buli bugodhe mu bantu.",
